## 3. Established facts about the supplied material (verified 2026-10-17)

**Dataset (OpenML 61, `iris`, version 1).** The values are measured. Source: `https://www.openml.org/api/v1/json/data/61` and the ARFF download.
- ARFF: `https://openml.org/data/v1/download/61/iris.arff` (redirects to www.openml.org), md5 `ad484452702105cbf3d30f8deaba39a9` (matches OpenML's `md5_checksum`). Parquet: `https://data.openml.org/datasets/0000/0061/dataset_61.pq`.
